docs {
  ## GET /api/retailer/recommendation-settings

  Fetches the AI recommendation engine configuration for the retailer.
  Includes LLM provider preference, confidence thresholds, and guardrail toggles.

  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  {
    "settings": {
      "preferredProvider": "STATIC-CALC",
      "confidenceThreshold": 0.75,
      "enableOutOfScopeGuardrail": true,
      "fallbackMessage": "Please consult our sizing guide for more help."
    }
  }
  ```
}
